- name: note
  id: note
  parameters:
    content: 'HD DIGITAL VOICE PROFILE

      16 kHz mono -> 100 Hz HPF -> 7 kHz LPF -> soft limiter

      Opus: 16 kbps CBR, 20 ms frames, 40-byte payload

      Framing: 16-bit sequence + CRC32

      FEC: K=7 rate-1/2 convolutional code + 22x34 bit interleaver

      Modem: differential Gray QPSK, 4 samples/symbol, excess BW 0.25

      Coded stream: 39.2 kbps -> 19.6 ksym/s -> 78.4 kS/s baseband

      Approximate occupied waveform class: 24.5 kHz

      Pluto: 627.2 kS/s sample stream; hardware RF bandwidth 200 kHz

      RX: software channel LPF -> QPSK timing/frequency/phase recovery -> Viterbi/CRC -> Opus PLC

      Install: sudo apt install libopus0 libopus-dev && python3 -m pip install opuslib

      First test with a cabled RF link and suitable attenuation. Do not connect TX directly to RX.

      Use only authorized frequencies/power/duty-cycle conditions.'
  states:
    coordinate: [40,740]
    rotation: 0
    state: enabled

